From 2e75ec0d3bbb90fa020a953f2a68fafac45f7efd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pavel Shirshov <pshirshov@eml.cc>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:38:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(coding-agent): backport border gesture and editor
 ownership corrections

Keep press identity through release and synthesized click, revoke stale ownership, and preserve open retained dialogs when replacing the editor. Backport only the corrections and regression/example coverage from a98affb onto the pinned v1.4.0 patched baseline; do not change runtime or catalogs.

Focused tests and scoped source/test typechecking and lint pass. Full check is blocked by unchanged baseline noUnsafeFinally in agent-session.ts; full typecheck also reports unchanged baseline test errors. Parent authorized this documented partial-validation local commit.

